[188.600637, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m● belay\u001b[0m\r\n  All 96 \"TRANSFER TO CREDIT CARD REFILL\" (main) matched cleanly to 96 \"INCOMING TRANSFER REFILL\" (credit) — 100% pair rate, no leftovers.\r\n\r\n"]
[188.60069, "o", "  **Transfers found:** money leaves `main` as \"TRANSFER TO CREDIT CARD REFILL\" and lands on `credit` as \"INCOMING TRANSFER REFILL\", 96 times across the whole history — that's just you refilling the card, not real income or spending. Want me to mark this pattern as an internal transfer (excluded from income/spending totals)?\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;36malex ▸ \u001b[0m"]
