[772.507013, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m● belay\u001b[0m\r\n  Saved to `CLAUDE.md` in the repo root — covers how you like this handled (awareness mode, no caps, transfers-not-income by default), what we agreed today (categories, yearly items, buffer goal, next review in October), and the `plan_month.py` lookback gotcha so it doesn't bite either of us again.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;36malex ▸ \u001b[0m"]
